				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Supporting Namespaces\nAnother objective of this Subsystem is to support the lookup of target classes, via the namespace search mechanism. Ths holds the key to contextual configuration. {{gtClass:PharoˆHub}} }"
